[00:07.34] (Floyd Jenkins)
[00:07.34] I know not where on earth to find you
[00:12.74] I don't know how or where to start
[00:19.62] I only know I'm here without you
[00:26.06] And there's pins and needles in my heart.
[00:33.04] The days and nights are growin' longer
[00:38.68] Since first you said that we must part
[00:45.38] But now I know I can't forget you
[00:51.72] I've got pins and needles in my heart.
[00:58.22] --- Instrumental ---
[01:05.68] I always see your face before me
[01:11.14] Your smile is heaven's work of art
[01:18.02] But now you're smiling at another
[01:24.54] And there's pins and needles in my heart.
[01:31.32] Someday, somewhere I'll find you
[01:36.92] And love will make the teardrops start
[01:43.48] And then you'll know how long I've waited
[01:49.96] With these pins and needles in my heart...
